# CORE: agnostic
# Project v2 board number for this repo's owner — the <n> in the board
# URL: github.com/users/<owner>/projects/<n> (or /orgs/<owner>/...).
#
# Single source of truth for server-side board sync
# (project-status-labeled.yml). Committed so both desktop and mobile
# sessions — and the workflows — can read it without `gh variable get`.
#
# Leave the value empty for labels-only mode (no board): the sync
# workflow logs a notice and does nothing.
#
# Mobile-pack repos must NOT also set the PROJECT_NUMBER repo variable
# (two sources of truth would drift); verify.sh fails if both are set.
PROJECT_NUMBER=4
